m/a/q3B4kYz\nA mage who has a loud, stubborn, and prideful personality. Can be mischievous and has a chuunibyou personality.\n\nI would like an illustration reflecting her chuunibyou personality, doing a pose of some kind! It can be silly! You can do whatever you want with the pose. I leave the composition of the piece up to you.\n\nThank you!", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tomoooo_888/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e30398fd/uploads/origins/fff4cb5a-031e-483b-b0e5-6e43fa333d67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=62586d13ff2ac47c28fa5f15cadc4af4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e30398fd/uploads/origins/fff4cb5a-031e-483b-b0e5-6e43fa333d67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=62586d13ff2ac47c28fa5f15cadc4af4, https://si.imgix.net/e30398fd/uploads/origins/fff4cb5a-031e-483b-b0e5-6e43fa333d67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7785139616d4726446e9b0ec2817065e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e30398fd/uploads/origins/fff4cb5a-031e-483b-b0e5-6e43fa333d67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4039a72fc4509b64966ae773c9f7d51a 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1783335, "client_id": 2363819, "nc": 144}, {"path": "/@tomoooo_888/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1783335, "client_id": 976307, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "ht