 eccentric and normally has his eyes closed. The blue cat is named Candy, and she is a social media star and fashionista. She's very trendy and energetic. They are best friends. They love eating Hong Kong street food, going to arcades, and shopping!\n\nPlease feel free to draw them in different outfits if you'd like! I really love the fashion that you draw!\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-pr6qTRB0yruvvyeTg0QawsORQtzzANh?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tomoooo_888/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1783335, "client_id": 172119, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0b419f5/uploads/origins/32d1147f-eff5-41d2-9947-85fda5612c3e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d585794dff39244ad5f72f01c43f9be3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d0b419f5/uploads/origins/32d1147f-eff5-41d2-9947-85fda5612c3e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d585794dff39244ad5f72f01c43f9be3, https://si.imgix.net/d0b419f5/uploads/origins/32d1147f-eff5-41d2-9947-85fda5612c3e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5bcee7a59affdd590148c62bed7f73f1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d0b419f5/uploads/origins/32d1147f-eff5-41d2-9947-85fda5612c3e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=daacf7ff54b1139d84bd582e1b3acff8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0b419f5/uploads/origins/32d1147f-eff5-41d2-9947-85fda5612c3e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=65a1875734561f1ef4604d67f1294126", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d0b419f5/uploads/origins/32d1147f-eff5-41d2-9947-85fda5612c3e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccomp